%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': {'background': '#FFFFFF', 'fontFamily': 'sans-serif', 'fontSize': '14px'}}}%%
flowchart TD
    %% ============ CHAT SIDE ============
    USER([Người Dùng]):::cUser -->|Câu hỏi + client_id/session_id| CHATPAGE[Chat Page]:::cApi
    CHATPAGE --> RUNTIME[Agent Runtime<br/>agent/runtime.py]:::cApi

    RUNTIME --> CTXMGR[Context Manager<br/>agent/context.py]:::cMem
    CTXMGR <-->|Đọc/ghi messages, memories| SQLITE[(SQLite<br/>sessions · messages · memories<br/>documents · document_chunks · ingestion_jobs)]:::cMem
    CTXMGR -->|conversation_history + memory_context| CORE

    subgraph REACT["Agent Core — ReAct Loop (agent/graph.py) — no router node"]
        direction TB
        CORE[Agent Node<br/>LLM + Provider Manager]:::cRouter
        CORE -->|tool_calls?| DECIDE{Model called<br/>a tool?}:::cRouter
        DECIDE -->|yes| TOOLS[Tool Node<br/>Tool Registry dispatch]:::cDb
        TOOLS -->|tool results appended| CORE
        DECIDE -->|no: final answer| VALIDATE
    end

    TOOLS -->|crag_search| CRAGTOOL[CRAG Tool<br/>tools/crag_search.py]:::cRetrieve
    TOOLS -->|controlled_web_search| WEBTOOL[Web Search Tool<br/>tools/web_search.py]:::cAmb

    CRAGTOOL --> RETRIEVE[Hybrid Retrieval<br/>Dense Chroma + BM25]:::cRetrieve
    RETRIEVE --> RRF[RRF Fusion k=60]:::cRetrieve
    RRF --> EVAL{Evaluator<br/>Reranker Sigmoid}:::cEval
    EVAL -->|CORRECT / AMBIGUOUS / INCORRECT +<br/>guidance for the model| REFINE[Refine Internal<br/>legal strips]:::cCorrect
    REFINE -->|evidence + crag_action| TOOLS

    WEBTOOL --> SEARCH[Controlled Web Search<br/>official domains only]:::cAmb
    SEARCH --> REFINEEXT[Refine External]:::cAmb
    REFINEEXT -->|evidence| TOOLS

    VALIDATE{Citation Validator}:::cVal --> ANSWER([Answer + Citations]):::cSuccess
    ANSWER --> PERSIST[Persist Turn<br/>agent/runtime.py]:::cApi
    PERSIST -->|user + assistant messages| SQLITE

    %% ============ ADMIN / INGESTION SIDE ============
    ADMIN([Admin]):::cUser -->|Upload PDF/DOCX/TXT| ADMINPAGE[Admin Page]:::cApi
    ADMINPAGE --> INGESTAPI[Ingestion API<br/>api/main.py]:::cApi
    INGESTAPI -->|create documents + ingestion_jobs row| SQLITE
    INGESTAPI --> WORKER[Background Worker<br/>ingestion/worker.py]:::cRetrieve

    WORKER --> P_PARSE[PARSING]:::cCorrect
    P_PARSE -->|scanned pages?| P_OCR[OCR — Vision LLM]:::cAmb
    P_PARSE --> P_STRUCT[STRUCTURING<br/>legal/parser.py]:::cCorrect
    P_OCR --> P_STRUCT
    P_STRUCT --> P_CHUNK[CHUNKING<br/>document_chunks]:::cCorrect
    P_CHUNK --> P_EMBED[EMBEDDING — hidden from Admin]:::cGen
    P_EMBED --> P_INDEX[INDEXING<br/>Chroma + BM25]:::cGen
    P_INDEX --> READY([status = READY]):::cSuccess
    READY -.->|only READY docs visible to| RETRIEVE
    P_CHUNK --> SQLITE
    P_INDEX --> SQLITE

    classDef cUser fill:#EBF8FF,stroke:#3182CE,stroke-width:2px,color:#2B6CB0;
    classDef cApi fill:#FAF5FF,stroke:#805AD5,stroke-width:2px,color:#553C9A;
    classDef cMem fill:#FEFCBF,stroke:#D69E2E,stroke-width:2px,color:#744210;
